      "meaning": "父图 analysis 节点：真实编译子图，输入完整 State；内部并行运行 left/right，只导出 AnalysisOutput。此动作是复合边界，不额外调用 record。",
      "input_type": "State",
      "output_type": "AnalysisOutput",
      "reads": [
        "parent_count",
        "parent_label",
        "parent_left",
        "parent_right",
        "calls",
        "parent_gate",
        "child_gate"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "parent_left",
        "parent_right",
        "child_count",
        "child_label",
        "child_left",
        "child_right",
