      "description": "完整父快照初始化子图；child START 同时调度 left/right。这里表示嵌套输入传播，不是 analysis 完成后再执行子节点。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "parallel_fork",
      "container": "analysis",
      "branches": [
        "left",
        "right"
      ],
      "description": "app.py:50-51 保留两个子分支；写入 child_left 与 child_right，未写入的子状态字段保留。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "compound_output_join",
      "container": "analysis",
      "bindings": [
        {
          "branch": "left",
          "output": "left",
          "boundary_output": "left"
        },
        {
          "branch": "right",
          "output": "right",
          "boundary_output": "right"
        }
      ],
      "description": "子图完成后由 AnalysisOutput 仅导出 left/right；count 和旧 label 不回写父图。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "parent_completion",
      "branches": [
        "refresh",
        "analysis"
      ],
      "description": "两个父分支结束后返回 State：prepare 的 count、refresh 的 label、analysis 的 left/right。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shared_effects",
      "description": "calls、parent_gate、child_gate 为可选外部对象。analysis 的 footprint 包含内部动作的传递效应，不表示重复执行。calls 中兄弟动作顺序不固定；prepare 在成功路径上先执行。"
    }
  ],
